---
import Page from "../../../layouts/Page.astro";
import { withBase } from "../../../utils/url";
import { LINKS } from "../../../consts";
import "../../../styles/pages/plant-breeding.css";
---

<Page title="A chemical screen for heat-stressed pollen · Marc Recio" description="Marc Recio's plant-breeding master's thesis: screening of chemical compounds promoting pollen development and germination of rapeseed under heat stress. 800 compounds, 8 candidates, the limits stated." nav="inner" footer="inner">
<main id="top">
  <section class="head" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <div class="container head__inner">
      <div>
        <a class="back" href={withBase("/")}><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Back to the landing</a>
        <p class="label"><span class="label__n">03</span>Selected work</p>
        <h1 id="page-title" class="page-title">A chemical screen for <span class="accent-word">heat-stressed pollen</span>.</h1>
        <p class="page-full">“Screening of chemical compounds promoting pollen development and germination of rapeseed under heat stress”</p>
        <p class="page-lead">My master's thesis in plant breeding at the Universitat Politècnica de València (COMAV), supervised by Dr. Ricardo Mir Moreno: an assay I built, and 800 compounds screened on it.</p>
        <div class="page-chips"><span class="chip">Graded 10/10</span><span class="tag">Master's thesis · UPV · 2024</span></div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="The four parts">
        <ul class="index">
          <li class="c-q"><a href="#question"><span class="flip__art photo-art photo-art--melt photo-art--wide"><img src={withBase("/work/cards/pollen-heat-controls.jpg")} alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="index__num">I.</span><span class="index__name">The question</span></a></li>
          <li class="c-assay"><a href="#assay"><span class="flip__art photo-art photo-art--melt"><img src={withBase("/work/cards/opentrons.jpg")} alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="index__num">II.</span><span class="index__name">The assay and its robot</span></a></li>
          <li class="c-screen"><a href="#screen"><span class="flip__art photo-art photo-art--melt"><img src={withBase("/work/cards/microscope.jpg")} alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="index__num">III.</span><span class="index__name">800 compounds, 8 candidates</span></a></li>
          <li class="c-now"><a href="#microspores"><span class="flip__art photo-art photo-art--melt"><img src={withBase("/work/cards/microspores-dapi.jpg")} alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="index__num">IV.</span><span class="index__name">Earlier in development</span></a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="part c-q" id="question" aria-labelledby="question-title">
    <div class="container part__grid">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="flip__art photo-art"><img src={withBase("/work/pollen-heat-controls.jpg")} alt="Rapeseed pollen of the controls: germinating at 23 °C, not at 38 °C" loading="lazy"></span>
        <span class="card__num">I.</span>
        <div><h2 id="question-title" class="card__title">The question</h2><p class="card__sum">What protects pollen from heat?</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="body reveal">
        <p>Pollen is one of the stages of a plant most sensitive to heat, and a warming climate makes it a direct threat to yield. In rapeseed, two hours at 38 °C all but stop its germination. Can a small molecule buffer that damage?</p>
        <figure class="fig panel">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 470 128" role="img" aria-label="Pollen germination: 54.7 to 60.8 percent without heat, at 23 °C; 1.8 percent at best after two hours at 38 °C" font-family="IBM Plex Sans, sans-serif"><text x="0" y="36" font-size="14" font-weight="600" data-pf="c-141414">23 °C</text><text x="0" y="52" font-size="12" data-pf="c-5f5f5f">no heat</text><rect x="120" y="22" width="186.0" height="26" rx="5" data-pf="c-5f6f2a"/><rect x="300.0" y="22" width="26.7" height="26" rx="5" data-pf="c-5f6f2a" opacity=".35"/><text x="130.0" y="40" font-size="13" font-weight="600" data-pf="c-ffffff">54.7–60.8%</text><text x="0" y="92" font-size="14" font-weight="600" data-pf="c-141414">38 °C</text><text x="0" y="108" font-size="12" data-pf="c-5f5f5f">two hours</text><rect x="120" y="78" width="6.1" height="26" rx="4" data-pf="c-a94c14"/><text x="134.1" y="96" font-size="13" font-weight="600" data-pf="c-a94c14">1.8% at best</text><path d="M120 12V116" data-ps="c-e2dbcf"/><text x="118" y="126" font-size="10.5" data-pf="c-6b6b6b" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace">0%</text><text x="460" y="126" font-size="10.5" data-pf="c-6b6b6b" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" text-anchor="end">100%</text></svg>
          <figcaption class="caption">Germination in vitro of rapeseed DH4079 pollen, without heat and after the shock (the thesis, p. 28).</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="part c-assay" id="assay" aria-labelledby="assay-title">
    <div class="container part__grid">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="flip__art photo-art photo-art--crop"><img src={withBase("/work/opentrons.jpg")} alt="The Opentrons OT-2 robot at work, its pipette over a plate" loading="lazy"></span>
        <span class="card__num">II.</span>
        <div><h2 id="assay-title" class="card__title">The assay and its robot</h2><p class="card__sum">A germination test I built, then ran 800 times.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="body reveal">
        <p>I tuned an in-vitro germination medium until its readout held steady. The 800 compounds, a natural-product-like library from Otava Chemicals, went through in ten rounds of four plates, laid out by an Opentrons OT-2 robot.</p>
<p>Each well was photographed four to six times and counted in ImageJ: a grain germinated when its tube reached half its length. FDA fluorescence read viability; DAPI and the confocal, the microspores' stages.</p>
        <figure class="fig panel duo">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 470 210" role="img" aria-label="One 24-well plate of the screen: 20 compound wells and four DMSO controls, two at 23 °C and two at 38 °C" font-family="IBM Plex Sans, sans-serif"><rect x="2" y="2" width="300" height="206" rx="16" data-pf="c-fbf8f3" data-ps="c-cfc6b6" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="18" y="48" font-size="11" data-pf="c-6b6b6b" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace">A</text><circle cx="52" cy="44" r="16" data-pf="c-eef0e2" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="96" cy="44" r="16" data-pf="c-eef0e2" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="140" cy="44" r="16" data-pf="c-eef0e2" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="184" cy="44" r="16" data-pf="c-eef0e2" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="228" cy="44" r="16" data-pf="c-eef0e2" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="272" cy="44" r="16" data-pf="c-e3eef0" data-ps="c-336f7e" stroke-width="2"/><text x="18" y="92" font-size="11" data-pf="c-6b6b6b" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace">B</text><circle cx="52" cy="88" r="16" data-pf="c-eef0e2" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="96" cy="88" r="16" data-pf="c-eef0e2" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="140" cy="88" r="16" data-pf="c-eef0e2" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="184" cy="88" r="16" data-pf="c-eef0e2" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="228" cy="88" r="16" data-pf="c-eef0e2" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="272" cy="88" r="16" data-pf="c-e3eef0" data-ps="c-336f7e" stroke-width="2"/><text x="18" y="136" font-size="11" data-pf="c-6b6b6b" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace">C</text><circle cx="52" cy="132" r="16" data-pf="c-eef0e2" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="96" cy="132" r="16" data-pf="c-eef0e2" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="140" cy="132" r="16" data-pf="c-eef0e2" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="184" cy="132" r="16" data-pf="c-eef0e2" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="228" cy="132" r="16" data-pf="c-eef0e2" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="272" cy="132" r="16" data-pf="c-f6e5da" data-ps="c-a94c14" stroke-width="2"/><text x="18" y="180" font-size="11" data-pf="c-6b6b6b" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace">D</text><circle cx="52" cy="176" r="16" data-pf="c-eef0e2" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="96" cy="176" r="16" data-pf="c-eef0e2" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="140" cy="176" r="16" data-pf="c-eef0e2" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="184" cy="176" r="16" data-pf="c-eef0e2" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="228" cy="176" r="16" data-pf="c-eef0e2" data-ps="c-5f6f2a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="272" cy="176" r="16" data-pf="c-f6e5da" data-ps="c-a94c14" stroke-width="2"/><text x="324" y="40" font-size="14" font-weight="600" data-pf="c-141414">20 compounds</text><text x="324" y="57" font-size="12" data-pf="c-5f5f5f">one well each, at 38 °C</text><circle cx="330" cy="88" r="7" data-pf="c-e3eef0" data-ps="c-336f7e" stroke-width="2"/><text x="344" y="92" font-size="12.5" data-pf="c-141414">2 controls, 23 °C</text><circle cx="330" cy="114" r="7" data-pf="c-f6e5da" data-ps="c-a94c14" stroke-width="2"/><text x="344" y="118" font-size="12.5" data-pf="c-141414">2 controls, 38 °C</text></svg>
          <img class="duo__photo" src={withBase("/work/plant-breeding.jpg")} alt="Four microscopy photos of plate 6A: the controls at 23 °C and at 38 °C, and two candidate wells, Hits 5 and 6, their germinated grains ringed in red" loading="lazy">
          <figcaption class="caption">One plate of a round, the controls' places drawn for clarity; below, plate 6A's controls and two candidates, their germinated grains ringed.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="part c-screen" id="screen" aria-labelledby="screen-title">
    <div class="container part__grid">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="flip__art photo-art photo-art--crop"><img src={withBase("/work/microscope.jpg")} alt="The inverted microscope and its camera, a photo of pollen on the screen beside it" loading="lazy"></span>
        <span class="card__num">III.</span>
        <div><h2 id="screen-title" class="card__title">800 compounds, 8 candidates</h2><p class="card__sum">Five above their control, three kept on their counts.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="body reveal">
        <p>Nineteen passed a first cut: two or more germinated grains per photo above their plate's control. A one-way ANOVA with Fisher's LSD at α 0.05, plate by plate in Statgraphics, put five above their control; three more were kept for their counts, though not significant.</p>
        <figure class="fig panel">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 470 214" role="img" aria-label="800 dots, one per compound; 19 past the first cut; 8 candidates, 5 of them above their control and 3 kept though not significant" font-family="IBM Plex Sans, sans-serif"><circle cx="4.0" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="10.5" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="17.0" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="23.5" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="30.0" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="36.5" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="43.0" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="49.5" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="56.0" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="62.5" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="69.0" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="75.5" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="82.0" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="88.5" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="95.0" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="101.5" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="108.0" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="114.5" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="121.0" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="127.5" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="134.0" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="140.5" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="147.0" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="153.5" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="160.0" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="166.5" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="173.0" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="179.5" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="186.0" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="192.5" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="199.0" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd3bd"/><circle cx="205.5" cy="4.0" r="2.6" data-pf="c-cfd