  <section class="part c-now" id="microspores" aria-labelledby="microspores-title">
    <div class="container part__grid">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="flip__art photo-art photo-art--crop"><img src={withBase("/work/microspores-dapi.jpg")} alt="Rapeseed microspores, their nuclei stained with DAPI" loading="lazy"></span>
        <span class="card__num">IV.</span>
        <div><h2 id="microspores-title" class="card__title">Earlier in development</h2><p class="card__sum">Microspores in vitro, to test the candidates earlier.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="body reveal">
        <p>Heat harms pollen most while it forms, so I set up a culture of rapeseed microspores in vitro, to test the candidates at earlier stages; those tests fall outside the thesis.</p>
